23
00:03:15,050 --> 00:03:22,320
432 - 215 = ?

24
00:03:22,320 --> 00:03:28,420
We set up and calculate step by step as follows:

25
00:03:28,420 --> 00:03:34,250
Step 1: Set up vertically

26
00:03:34,250 --> 00:03:53,320
Write hundreds under hundreds, tens under tens, ones under ones.

27
00:03:53,320 --> 00:04:00,920
Step 2: Calculate from right to left

28
00:04:01,350 --> 00:04:12,470
2 cannot subtract 5, take 12 minus 5 equals 7, write 7 carry 1.

29
00:04:12,470 --> 00:04:22,320
1 plus 1 equals 2; 3 minus 2 equals 1, write 1.

30
00:04:22,650 --> 00:04:29,170
4 minus 2 equals 2, write 2.

31
00:04:29,170 --> 00:04:38,700
So 432 - 215 = 217

32
00:04:38,700 --> 00:04:44,270
Similarly we perform the calculation

33
00:04:44,270 --> 00:04:51,170
627 - 143 = ?

34
00:04:51,170 --> 00:04:56,670
We set up and calculate step by step as follows:

35
00:04:56,670 --> 00:05:01,020
Step 1: Set up vertically

36
00:05:01,020 --> 00:05:16,450
Write hundreds under hundreds, tens under tens, ones under ones.

37
00:05:16,450 --> 00:05:22,820
Step 2: Calculate from right to left

38
00:05:22,820 --> 00:05:28,570
7 minus 3 equals 4, write 4.

39
00:05:28,570 --> 00:05:41,120
2 cannot subtract 4, take 12 minus 4 equals 8, write 8, carry 1.

40
00:05:41,570 --> 00:05:53,120
1 plus 1 equals 2; 6 minus 2 equals 4, write 4.

41
00:05:53,120 --> 00:06:03,400
So 627 - 143 = 484

